[{"text": "And now I give the floor to her", "start": 0.48, "duration": 8.56}, {"text": "excellency Muripola Anar Roa Al Morio,", "start": 3.04, "duration": 8.0}, {"text": "Deputy Prime Minister and the Minister", "start": 9.04, "duration": 5.759}, {"text": "of Finance of Samoa.", "start": 11.04, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "I", "start": 14.799, "duration": 5.081}, {"text": "ask the", "start": 16.56, "duration": 3.32}, {"text": "I ask the protocol to escort her", "start": 21.039, "duration": 7.24}, {"text": "excellency to the podium.", "start": 24.16, "duration": 4.119}, {"text": "Moa,", "start": 47.68, "duration": 3.0}, {"text": "President President,", "start": 66.88, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "let me begin by warmly congratulating", "start": 68.88, "duration": 7.36}, {"text": "his excellency Mr. Kalula Raman", "start": 72.0, "duration": 8.479}, {"text": "on his election as president of the 81st", "start": 76.24, "duration": 8.0}, {"text": "session of the general assembly.", "start": 80.479, "duration": 7.361}, {"text": "The chosen theme for the general debate,", "start": 84.24, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "restoring trust, managing", "start": 87.84, "duration": 4.319}, {"text": "transformation,", "start": 90.24, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "a united nation that delivers for all.", "start": 92.159, "duration": 6.96}, {"text": "could not be more timely.", "start": 96.24, "duration": 5.199}, {"text": "And it speaks to the reality of the", "start": 99.119, "duration": 5.201}, {"text": "world we face today.", "start": 101.439, "duration": 5.761}, {"text": "A world shaped by uncertainty,", "start": 104.32, "duration": 7.2}, {"text": "disruption, and rapid change, but also", "start": 107.2, "duration": 9.52}, {"text": "by hope, innovation, and opportunity.", "start": 111.52, "duration": 9.68}, {"text": "For Samoa, the theme is a promise the", "start": 116.72, "duration": 7.6}, {"text": "world must keep.", "start": 121.2, "duration": 6.559}, {"text": "Can trust be restored?", "start": 124.32, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "Can transformation protect the", "start": 127.759, "duration": 4.161}, {"text": "vulnerable?", "start": 129.92, "duration": 4.959}, {"text": "The answer lies in the first words of", "start": 131.92, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "our UN charter.", "start": 134.879, "duration": 4.961}, {"text": "We the peoples.", "start": 137.28, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "We must always put people at the center", "start": 139.84, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "of our decisions.", "start": 143.52, "duration": 6.719}, {"text": "For us, this is undermined by the core", "start": 146.16, "duration": 8.24}, {"text": "values of our salmon culture. the Fasam", "start": 150.239, "duration": 9.121}, {"text": "and our faith such as respect, dignity,", "start": 154.4, "duration": 9.28}, {"text": "love, protection and service.", "start": 159.36, "duration": 6.4}, {"text": "Excellencies,", "start": 163.68, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "every decision in this hall shapes the", "start": 165.76, "duration": 7.68}, {"text": "world that every child inherits.", "start": 169.12, "duration": 8.08}, {"text": "We meet at a pivotal moment in history.", "start": 173.44, "duration": 6.879}, {"text": "Profound and transformative changes are", "start": 177.2, "duration": 8.08}, {"text": "not only necessary but inevitable.", "start": 180.319, "duration": 7.28}, {"text": "Across many societies,", "start": 185.28, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "people are increasingly asking whether", "start": 187.599, "duration": 6.161}, {"text": "global institution are delivering on the", "start": 190.72, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "promises made to them.", "start": 193.76, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "We must prepare ourselves to face the", "start": 196.8, "duration": 6.799}, {"text": "challenges ahead. We presolve and use", "start": 199.92, "duration": 7.2}, {"text": "the opportunity to herald in much needed", "start": 203.599, "duration": 7.041}, {"text": "reforms for the benefits of all and", "start": 207.12, "duration": 6.96}, {"text": "leaving no one behind.", "start": 210.64, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "For Samoa, multilateralism", "start": 214.08, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "remains the cornerstone of our", "start": 217.28, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "international engagement.", "start": 219.84, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "Only through genuine cooperation and", "start": 222.72, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "mutual trust can we craft solution that", "start": 225.2, "duration": 7.679}, {"text": "no single nation could achieve alone.", "start": 228.56, "duration": 8.399}, {"text": "The UN80 initiative has merits but also", "start": 232.879, "duration": 8.161}, {"text": "its risk if not fully assessed and", "start": 236.959, "duration": 8.161}, {"text": "understood. Any reform must strengthen", "start": 241.04, "duration": 7.68}, {"text": "delivery on the ground by eliminating", "start": 245.12, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "duplication,", "start": 248.72, "duration": 4.799}, {"text": "improving coherence and accelerating", "start": 250.4, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "impact.", "start": 253.519, "duration": 3.521}, {"text": "Critically,", "start": 255.28, "duration": 4.639}, {"text": "such reforms must not weaken the", "start": 257.04, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "operation of the UN multi-country", "start": 259.919, "duration": 5.601}, {"text": "offices or the resident coordinator", "start": 262.56, "duration": 4.639}, {"text": "system.", "start": 265.52, "duration": 4.16}, {"text": "We sa mo reaffirms its unwavering", "start": 267.199, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "commitment to the United Nation as the", "start": 269.68, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "premier forum to address global crisis.", "start": 272.479, "duration": 7.361}, {"text": "We also caution AAN's premature decision", "start": 276.0, "duration": 6.96}, {"text": "taken without the full consideration and", "start": 279.84, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "endorsement by member states.", "start": 282.96, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "Excellencies,", "start": 286.16, "duration": 4.08}, {"text": "climate change remains the single", "start": 288.08, "duration": 5.679}, {"text": "greatest threat to Samoa and the global", "start": 290.24, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "community.", "start": 293.759, "duration": 4.961}, {"text": "Its impacts are more extensively felt by", "start": 295.44, "duration": 7.68}, {"text": "seeds due to our special circumstances.", "start": 298.72, "duration": 8.479}, {"text": "As the ICJ advisory opinion puts it,", "start": 303.12, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "climate change is not merely an", "start": 307.199, "duration": 6.801}, {"text": "environmental concern but an existential", "start": 309.84, "duration": 7.44}, {"text": "problem of planetary proportion that", "start": 314.0, "duration": 7.36}, {"text": "require urgent global action.", "start": 317.28, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "The United Nation General Assembly", "start": 321.36, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "welcome the unanimous ICJ advisory", "start": 323.84, "duration": 7.6}, {"text": "opinion and affirm its importance as an", "start": 327.36, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "authoritative contribution to the", "start": 331.44, "duration": 5.039}, {"text": "clarification of existing international", "start": 334.0, "duration": 4.4}, {"text": "law.", "start": 336.479, "duration": 4.401}, {"text": "Climate finance is the bridge between", "start": 338.4, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "ambition and action. It must be scaled", "start": 340.88, "duration": 7.2}, {"text": "up, easily accessible, devoid of", "start": 344.32, "duration": 7.12}, {"text": "burdensome condition and responsive to", "start": 348.08, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "the needs of the most climate", "start": 351.44, "duration": 3.68}, {"text": "vulnerable.", "start": 353.44, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "Resources intended for education,", "start": 355.12, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "health, water, and social protection are", "start": 358.16, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "now diverted to disaster recovery.", "start": 361.44, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "Small nations are being asked to finance", "start": 364.88, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "both development and survival.", "start": 367.6, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "No nation should have to borrow its way", "start": 370.8, "duration": 5.679}, {"text": "out of a crisis it did so little to", "start": 373.12, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "create.", "start": 376.479, "duration": 3.44}, {"text": "Excellencies,", "start": 378.24, "duration": 3.84}, {"text": "the world is facing a growing", "start": 379.919, "duration": 5.521}, {"text": "development financing crisis. The gap", "start": 382.08, "duration": 5.679}, {"text": "between commitments and delivery", "start": 385.44, "duration": 6.4}, {"text": "continues to widen and too often we", "start": 387.759, "duration": 7.681}, {"text": "simply rebrand and recycle old ideas", "start": 391.84, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "while failing to deliver tangible", "start": 395.44, "duration": 3.84}, {"text": "progress.", "start": 397.52, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "Meanwhile, multilateralism is under", "start": 399.28, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "siege and international financial", "start": 402.08, "duration": 6.239}, {"text": "commitments are being eroded.", "start": 404.8, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "The current international financial", "start": 408.319, "duration": 4.641}, {"text": "architecture was designed for a", "start": 410.4, "duration": 5.519}, {"text": "different era. It struggles to", "start": 412.96, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "adequately recognize vulnerability and", "start": 415.919, "duration": 6.481}, {"text": "fails to fully account for the realities", "start": 418.96, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "faced by seeds.", "start": 422.4, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "A fairer financial system is not only in", "start": 424.8, "duration": 6.799}, {"text": "the interest of developing countries. It", "start": 428.08, "duration": 6.239}, {"text": "is in the interest of global stability", "start": 431.599, "duration": 5.761}, {"text": "and shared prosperity.", "start": 434.319, "duration": 4.481}, {"text": "The implementation of the", "start": 437.36, "duration": 3.839}, {"text": "multi-dimensional vulnerability index", "start": 438.8, "duration": 5.519}, {"text": "MVI in financing decision making is", "start": 441.199, "duration": 6.481}, {"text": "essential if we are to genuinely address", "start": 444.319, "duration": 5.921}, {"text": "the financial challenges facing", "start": 447.68, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "developing countries.", "start": 450.24, "duration": 5.359}, {"text": "We thank the secretary general and UN", "start": 452.96, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "Desa for their proactive efforts in", "start": 455.599, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "moving this issue forward with", "start": 458.72, "duration": 4.879}, {"text": "international financial institution. I", "start": 461.039, "duration": 5.921}, {"text": "advised and we look forward to the pilot", "start": 463.599, "duration": 7.121}, {"text": "project to demonstrate the MBI can help", "start": 466.96, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "developing countries in their financing", "start": 470.72, "duration": 4.4}, {"text": "challenges", "start": 473.28, "duration": 5.199}, {"text": "on debt. We need to build a sustainable,", "start": 475.12, "duration": 7.28}, {"text": "equitable and fair debt regime starting", "start": 478.479, "duration": 7.12}, {"text": "with a robust mechanism for debt", "start": 482.4, "duration": 4.799}, {"text": "restructuring.", "start": 485.599, "duration": 3.921}, {"text": "Debt forgiveness must be linked to", "start": 487.199, "duration": 4.801}, {"text": "measurable progress on resilience", "start": 489.52, "duration": 5.119}, {"text": "building and investment in resilient", "start": 492.0, "duration": 6.479}, {"text": "today will reduce the cost of disasters", "start": 494.639, "duration": 5.921}, {"text": "tomorrow.", "start": 498.479, "duration": 4.961}, {"text": "Samo supports the incorporation of state", "start": 500.56, "duration": 6.639}, {"text": "contingent clauses in debt instruments", "start": 503.44, "duration": 7.84}, {"text": "allowing for suspension during crisis.", "start": 507.199, "duration": 6.161}, {"text": "Excellencies,", "start": 511.28, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "energy is both a driver and accelerator", "start": 513.36, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "for Samoan sustainable development", "start": 516.64, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "ambition.", "start": 519.12, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "Energy security has become a defining", "start": 520.88, "duration": 7.44}, {"text": "issue for many small island nations.", "start": 524.08, "duration": 6.319}, {"text": "While we have one of the highest shares", "start": 528.32, "duration": 5.199}, {"text": "of renewable electricity in the Pacific,", "start": 530.399, "duration": 5.681}, {"text": "Samour remains heavily dependent on", "start": 533.519, "duration": 6.721}, {"text": "imported fuels. Successive energy crisis", "start": 536.08, "duration": 7.84}, {"text": "and the 2026 fuel crisis expose the", "start": 540.24, "duration": 7.92}, {"text": "economic cost of our energy dependence.", "start": 543.92, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "We are working towards a whole of system", "start": 548.16, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "transformation that delivers electricity", "start": 550.8, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "that is reliable and affordable, reduces", "start": 553.68, "duration": 6.159}, {"text": "our dependence on imported fuels,", "start": 557.12, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "strengthens resilience and supports", "start": 559.839, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "sustainable development.", "start": 562.48, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "The clean energy transition is also an", "start": 565.519, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "opportunity for Sam to build a smarter,", "start": 568.72, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "more resilient and investment ready", "start": 571.839, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "energy system. The digital", "start": 574.24, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "transformation including AI and data", "start": 576.959, "duration": 6.401}, {"text": "analytics offers real opportunities to", "start": 579.76, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "drive an inclusive just energy", "start": 583.36, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "transition particularly through off-grid", "start": 586.0, "duration": 7.36}, {"text": "solution and smarter energy planning.", "start": 588.88, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "Excellencies,", "start": 593.36, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "the ocean defines who we are as specific", "start": 595.04, "duration": 8.4}, {"text": "people. It connects us, sustains us and", "start": 598.0, "duration": 8.0}, {"text": "shapes our identity.", "start": 603.44, "duration": 5.519}, {"text": "Yet our ocean faces increasing pressures", "start": 606.0, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "from pollution, biodiversity loss, over", "start": 608.959, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "exploitation, and the impacts of climate", "start": 612.88, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "change.", "start": 615.839, "duration": 4.481}, {"text": "Pursuing economic growth has come at a", "start": 617.44, "duration": 6.399}, {"text": "grave cost to our marine ecosystem.", "start": 620.32, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "Coupled with unchecked exploitation of", "start": 623.839, "duration": 6.081}, {"text": "deep sea bed mineral resources, our", "start": 626.56, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "oceans face a crisis of limitless", "start": 629.92, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "proportion.", "start": 633.12, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "And these planetary changes have no", "start": 634.72, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "middle ground. Weak governance", "start": 637.44, "duration": 6.8}, {"text": "frameworks threatens what remains.", "start": 640.16, "duration": 7.52}, {"text": "Without urgent action, small island", "start": 644.24, "duration": 7.52}, {"text": "states face a future without land and no", "start": 647.68, "duration": 6.48}, {"text": "usable ocean.", "start": 651.76, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "It is time to transform how we value and", "start": 654.16, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "interact with the ocean. from a resource", "start": 657.76, "duration": 7.6}, {"text": "we exploit to one we protect and cherish", "start": 660.88, "duration": 8.48}, {"text": "and we must do more on this front.", "start": 665.36, "duration": 8.0}, {"text": "Samo has ratified the BB&J agreement and", "start": 669.36, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "we remain actively engaged in", "start": 673.36, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "negotiations toward a global treaty on", "start": 675.6, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "plastic pollution particularly to", "start": 678.88, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "protect our marine environment.", "start": 681.76, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "We remain committed to implementing the", "start": 684.64, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "AIA Commonwealth Ocean Declaration, the", "start": 687.04, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "2026 Pacific Island Forum Leaders Ocean", "start": 690.48, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "Statements and our own Samoa Ocean", "start": 693.92, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "Strategy.", "start": 697.12, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "These are critical to the implementation", "start": 698.88, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "of SDG14.", "start": 701.92, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "Our maritime domain is increasingly", "start": 704.32, "duration": 6.4}, {"text": "exploited by transnational criminal", "start": 707.68, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "networks involved in illegal", "start": 710.72, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "trafficking, including illicit drugs", "start": 712.88, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "moving through our region. Illicit drugs", "start": 716.16, "duration": 7.44}, {"text": "enter homes, harm young people, fuel", "start": 719.6, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "violence, and place increasing pressure", "start": 723.6, "duration": 6.96}, {"text": "on communities and essential services.", "start": 726.48, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "Excellencies,", "start": 730.56, "duration": 4.399}, {"text": "non-communicable disease represents one", "start": 732.24, "duration": 5.039}, {"text": "of the most serious development", "start": 734.959, "duration": 5.761}, {"text": "challenges to Samour's public health and", "start": 737.279, "duration": 5.921}, {"text": "economic productivity.", "start": 740.72, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "In response, we are shifting towards", "start": 743.2, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "prevention through strengthening health", "start": 745.92, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "literacy, reforming school nutrition and", "start": 748.48, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "food environments and early intervention", "start": 752.48, "duration": 4.08}, {"text": "programs.", "start": 755.04, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "And this includes our early childhood", "start": 756.56, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "development framework,", "start": 759.68, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "a multissectoral road map to ensure", "start": 761.92, "duration": 7.12}, {"text": "every child from pregnancy to age five", "start": 765.6, "duration": 7.76}, {"text": "receives nurturing care, protection and", "start": 769.04, "duration": 6.799}, {"text": "early learning.", "start": 773.36, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "Excellencies,", "start": 775.839, "duration": 4.721}, {"text": "in many of our Pacific countries, our", "start": 777.6, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "water systems are highly vulnerable to", "start": 780.56, "duration": 4.16}, {"text": "disruptions", "start": 783.12, "duration": 3.76}, {"text": "and these realities demand that the", "start": 784.72, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "global water agenda fully recognize the", "start": 786.88, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "special circumstances of seeds.", "start": 790.0, "duration": 6.48}, {"text": "Samour's priorities are four-fold.", "start": 793.2, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "First, climate resilient water system", "start": 796.48, "duration": 6.479}, {"text": "must be scaled up urgently. Second,", "start": 799.36, "duration": 6.4}, {"text": "access to finance must be s", "start": 802.959, "duration": 6.081}, {"text": "significantly improved. And third,", "start": 805.76, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "capacity and partnerships must be", "start": 809.04, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "strengthened. And finally, we need a", "start": 811.2, "duration": 6.319}, {"text": "transnational water governance regime", "start": 814.48, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "informed by the outcomes of the various", "start": 817.519, "duration": 6.161}, {"text": "water conferences held over the last", "start": 820.0, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "eight years.", "start": 823.68, "duration": 4.959}, {"text": "Excellencies,", "start": 826.24, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "Samo remains a peaceful country,", "start": 828.639, "duration": 6.401}, {"text": "steadfast in our commitment to human", "start": 832.24, "duration": 5.039}, {"text": "rights and justice.", "start": 835.04, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "We remain concerned by the ongoing wars", "start": 837.279, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "in Ukraine, Kasa, and Iran.", "start": 839.92, "duration": 7.039}, {"text": "The terrible loss of civilian lives,", "start": 843.519, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "displacement of people, as well as the", "start": 846.959, "duration": 5.361}, {"text": "destruction of infrastructure and the", "start": 849.839, "duration": 4.881}, {"text": "environment is something we do not", "start": 852.32, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "condone.", "start": 854.72, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "The continued supply of weapons to fuel", "start": 856.56, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "conflicts must end.", "start": 859.36, "duration": 6.479}, {"text": "We also reiterate our long-standing call", "start": 862.56, "duration": 6.399}, {"text": "for meaningful reform of the Security", "start": 865.839, "duration": 6.081}, {"text": "Council to ensure that it remains", "start": 868.959, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "effective, credible, and representative", "start": 871.92, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "of today's realities.", "start": 875.199, "duration": 6.161}, {"text": "It is imperative that the UN resolves", "start": 878.0, "duration": 6.079}, {"text": "disputes peacefully and strengthen", "start": 881.36, "duration": 6.96}, {"text": "international peace and security.", "start": 884.079, "duration": 7.44}, {"text": "The world needs a stronger commitment to", "start": 888.32, "duration": 4.879}, {"text": "peace.", "start": 891.519, "duration": 3.921}, {"text": "Not more division,", "start": 893.199, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "not more conflict and not more", "start": 895.44, "duration": 5.519}, {"text": "suffering.", "start": 898.399, "duration": 4.401}, {"text": "Excellencies,", "start": 900.959, "duration": 4.721}, {"text": "at its hearts, Samoa's development", "start": 902.8, "duration": 7.36}, {"text": "journey is about investing in people. We", "start": 905.68, "duration": 7.2}, {"text": "are strengthening social protection,", "start": 910.16, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "investing in youth, supporting women and", "start": 912.88, "duration": 5.759}, {"text": "persons with disabilities, and building", "start": 916.0, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "a resilient economy.", "start": 918.639, "duration": 5.121}, {"text": "And these efforts are championed through", "start": 921.04, "duration": 5.599}, {"text": "our district development program", "start": 923.76, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "delivered across all 51 districts,", "start": 926.639, "duration": 7.121}, {"text": "empowering our communities. Our greatest", "start": 929.92, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "source of resilience will not be our", "start": 933.76, "duration": 7.12}, {"text": "infrastructure or our institution alone.", "start": 936.48, "duration": 8.96}, {"text": "It will be our people healthy, skilled,", "start": 940.88, "duration": 7.519}, {"text": "educated and empowered.", "start": 945.44, "duration": 6.48}, {"text": "And this is why the Aya or family is at", "start": 948.399, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "the heart of our pathway for the", "start": 951.92, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "development of Samoa.", "start": 954.079, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "Excellencies,", "start": 957.36, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "I pay tribute to our outgoing Secretary", "start": 958.959, "duration": 6.721}, {"text": "General Antonio Couteras for his", "start": 962.16, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "steadfast leadership and enduring", "start": 965.68, "duration": 6.079}, {"text": "commitment to the United Nations. His", "start": 968.48, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "legacy will continue to guide our", "start": 971.759, "duration": 5.601}, {"text": "collective efforts in advancing peace,", "start": 974.16, "duration": 6.479}, {"text": "dignity, and sustainable development for", "start": 977.36, "duration": 5.599}, {"text": "all.", "start": 980.639, "duration": 4.081}, {"text": "Excellencies,", "start": 982.959, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "before I am a leader, I am first and", "start": 984.72, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "foremost a mother. History may record", "start": 988.079, "duration": 6.081}, {"text": "our titles, but our children will", "start": 991.44, "duration": 7.199}, {"text": "inherit our choices. And this is why now", "start": 994.16, "duration": 7.679}, {"text": "more than ever, the United Nations", "start": 998.639, "duration": 7.281}, {"text": "matters. We must continue to stand as", "start": 1001.839, "duration": 7.841}, {"text": "one United Nations family.", "start": 1005.92, "duration": 5.919}, {"text": "God bless", "start": 1009.68, "duration": 5.159}, {"text": "Maya.", "start": 1011.839, "duration": 3.0}, {"text": "Thank you. I thank the deputy prime", "start": 1017.36, "duration": 6.599}, {"text": "minister of Samoa.", "start": 1019.519, "duration": 4.44}, {"text": "And now I give the floor to his", "start": 1024.64, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "excellency.", "start": 1026.88, "duration": 2.48}]